om/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commit/be718a614bcdcc8290fa8f96058df07348bfb90e", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commits/be718a614bcdcc8290fa8f96058df07348bfb90e/comments", "author": null, "committer": null, "parents": [{"sha": "ac08b109c0bacdfabd07f862615fb91f67ec78a5", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commits/ac08b109c0bacdfabd07f862615fb91f67ec78a5", "html_url": "https://github.com/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commit/ac08b109c0bacdfabd07f862615fb91f67ec78a5"}]}, {"sha": "7a06e21317c027bf77c9a5429bbc221baa7afaf5", "node_id": "C_kwDONWqoC9oAKDdhMDZlMjEzMTdjMDI3YmY3N2M5YTU0MjliYmMyMjFiYWE3YWZhZjU", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Henri Philipps", "email": "hphilipps@gitlab.com", "date": "2022-06-22T15:55:54Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Jason Plum", "email": "jplum@gitlab.com", "date": "2022-06-22T15:55:54Z"}, "message": "Allow configuration of hpa stabilization window", "tree": {"sha": "2539d2e235caa46fb83c45b41418a1e55ef3f491", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/git/trees/2539d2e235caa46fb83c45b41418a1e55ef3f491"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/git/commits/7a06e21317c027bf77c9a5429bbc221baa7afaf5", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commits/7a06e21317c027bf77c9a5429bbc221baa7afaf5", "html_url": "https://github.com/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commit/7a06e21317c027bf77c9a5429bbc221baa7afaf5", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commits/7a06e21317c027bf77c9a5429bbc221baa7afaf5/comments", "author": null, "committer": {"login": "WarheadsSE", "id": 585036, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTAzNg==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/585036?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE", "html_url": "https://github.com/WarheadsSE", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "1ea8fdae83d5c7f8e095641539bacb4a51bc8ead", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commits/1ea8fdae83d5c7f8e095641539bacb4a51bc8ead", "html_url": "https://github.com/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commit/1ea8fdae83d5c7f8e095641539bacb4a51bc8ead"}]}, {"sha": "8ac8d5b32e2d06c8822d747c6c1ef6638ae4edb3", "node_id": "MDY6Q29tbWl0ODk2MTgyMjgzOjhhYzhkNWIzMmUyZDA2Yzg4MjJkNzQ3YzZjMWVmNjYzOGFlNGVkYjM=", "commit": {"author": {"name": "John Skarbek", "email": "jskarbek@gitlab.com", "date": "2021-01-29T22:34:28Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Jason Plum", "email": "jplum@gitlab.com", "date": "2021-01-29T22:34:28Z"}, "message": "Adds common labels for Kubernetes Agent Chart\n\nIntroduces an option that helps apply a set of labels spread across all\nobjects associated with the GitLab Kubernetes Agent (`kas`) chart.  Given the following:\n\n```yaml\nglobal:\n  common:\n    labels:\n      baz: \"bat\"\ngitlab:\n  kas:\n    common:\n      labels:\n        foo: \"bar\"\n```\n\nThe label set `baz=bat` is applied to all objects created by the GitLab\nKAS Chart (:warning: this is to expand to encompass all objects in the\nfuture, but this MR is already large :warning:).  The label set\n`foo=bar` is applied to all objects for _**only**_ the GitLab KAS\nChart.\n\nThere are additional methods we can apply labels to various objects.\n\n```yaml\nglobal:\n  common:\n    labels:\n      common: label\n  pod:\n    labels:\n      common_pod: label\n  service:\n    labels:\n      common_service: label\ngitlab:\n  kas:\n    podLabels:\n      extra_pod: label\n    serviceLabels:\n      extra_service: label\n```\n\nWe expect to see all labels appropriately applied to the necessary\nobjects.  We `merge` items for the chart that we are operating on into\nthe common labels to help avoid creating duplicate labels.  Example,\nlabels added specifically to the GitLab KAS chart are merged into the\nlabels that are provided to the `global.common.labels` section.  We\nattempt to manage precedence as best possible leveraging the `merge`\nfunction.  Helm performs the following when building the template:\n\n* `gitlab.kas.podLabels` > `gitlab.kas.common.labels` > `global.pod.labels` > `global.common.labels` => Applies to the Deployment object for the GitLab KAS\n* `gitlab.kas.serviceLabels` > `gitlab.kas.common.labels` > `global.service.labels` > `global.common.labels` => Applies to the Service object for the GitLab KAS\n* `gitlab.kas.common.labels` > `global.common.labels` => Applies to essentially all other objects other than the above.\n\nNote that we do not interfere with the standard set of labels that we\ngenerate in the `_application.tpl`.  Users will still have the chance of\ncreating labels that may interfere with each other, but the possibility\nshould be low as the items generated us in `gitlab.standardLabels` are\nvery minimal, would interfere with label selectors, and very common in\nthe helm ecosystem.\n\nShould labels be repetitive, Helm will NOT bail, Kubernetes will NOT\nthrow a warning, instead Kubernetes will take in the last key value pair\nin the label hash.  It is considered invalid YAML and will mark the\nappropriate keys as duplicates, and as such this will fail any YAML\nlinting.", "tree": {"sha": "393b1624f0cee4e937c54ac052396cac63b0fd75", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/git/trees/393b1624f0cee4e937c54ac052396cac63b0fd75"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/git/commits/8ac8d5b32e2d06c8822d747c6c1ef6638ae4edb3", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commits/8ac8d5b32e2d06c8822d747c6c1ef6638ae4edb3", "html_url": "https://github.com/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commit/8ac8d5b32e2d06c8822d747c6c1ef6638ae4edb3", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/paradyme-management/gitlab-chart/commits/8ac8d5b32e2d06c8822d747c6c1ef6638ae4edb3/comments", "author": null, "committer": {"login": "WarheadsSE", "id": 585036, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTAzNg==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/585036?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE", "html_url": "https://github.com/WarheadsSE", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/WarheadsSE/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "095d528276c8dbbd53c7723c4ca1eeb0eac14578", "url": "https: